  <data name="Hiw_S2Tekst" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Where other apps make you scroll through hundreds of profiles, Node works differently. Our matching combines astrological compatibility with your Node agent's insight, and carefully introduces you to people who truly match your energy and intentions.</value>
